{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_014_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d7308afe85a465a5356b77646c2b4b99c97d89353532249e1f5b7966b47c8668",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_014_22:5_02_014_22_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8d2d7a6c18869e434a72160d8ede56d441e7b8584988b92d45f4bb1e05c3bda",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_014_22:5_02_014_22_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1675c7ad4238e1dc926f252128fe080008ce8ec308d774029c7ec87413f44a17",
      "text": "想送你情人节的回礼，\n现在能稍微借我一点时间吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_014_22:5_02_014_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ea90ebaabec1a0c5728450a4542e95b4291ee2a6540f9601e4b31bfa89d3ad5",
      "text": "那时谢谢你的巧克力啊。吃了之后\n感觉涌出了力量，工作的状态也变好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_014_22:5_02_014_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad9a3325d8f7c40a725f1554be8c46c299bb61b226d413567aff260323212cd3",
      "text": "这份回礼里也倾注了希望你能恢复精神、\n工作状态也能变好的心意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_014_22:5_02_014_22_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad457f393287c44c0dc3a7985f9a775b5de856fb0b6d8fac2a269dce2f354821",
      "text": "请收下吧。若是合你心意我就很高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_014_22:5_02_014_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f8502f5288c2ed17f80d11b1d474808025b55bdfc98967fe26621980a69dc49",
      "text": "今天的工作也结束了呢。\n辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_014_22:5_02_014_22_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e57421ae3541d96577f0b983149f31fc85230880b5be715b4453896c620dc189",
      "text": "我有东西想交给你。\n这个，是情人节的回礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_014_22:5_02_014_22_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:476d6be98b9471d02cd42d0c7ed8f82b1a56848a3ae2c06ec07202fe54c11d98",
      "text": "本来想着早点给你的。\n在琢磨时机的时候，不知不觉就到现在了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_014_22:5_02_014_22_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:568bdfba6c0acfbb6694bd54b4ed40c742d3c9808beb7ed086ea56185db5bc6b",
      "text": "回礼我选了感觉你可能会喜欢的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_014_22:5_02_014_22_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c98fc73cf1c568f5d3d157e8cffd6dcd5cc2d5162d4d880f465871762ec17c6",
      "text": "另外，也倾注了不输给你在巧克力里倾注的心意哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_014_22:5_02_014_22_b:cmd-000040:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78f5d07e1298a12fa5c9a656fa180adc505aaf10f06db802b00fa434df2a4fb6",
      "text": "非常感谢。我会好好珍惜的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_014_22:5_02_014_22_b:cmd-000041:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9591dc30166c3bafe53a9e8d41437b12f720f018453f122b035ebeb6fe1f6ea0",
      "text": "你的心意我已经切实感受到了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_014_22:5_02_014_22_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ad73c95b44f0a1f4ad20581296f93e791fa04211a4ec802a7b9a16189e9d84c",
      "text": "啊啊，要是能合你心意我就很高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_014_22:5_02_014_22_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c57946be97b3a3569f83d37312366265177254a1f20368bad15eabb41a9d9e7",
      "text": "这样啊。看来没白费功夫呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_014_22:5_02_014_22_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14872a2404c9e9cd28f86bf05601de8187672d82c7640e3d3aff13e9720a85ce",
      "text": "能看到你高兴的样子真是太好了。\n光是这样，准备回礼就很有意义了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
